/src/CRMS.Web.Intranet/storage/collateral/bc5294f5-7905-4d06-adb4-ee5ed4395ea7/documents

# Uploaded and generated documents (local file-storage provider)
#
# This is the on-disk store the local/dev IFileStorageService writes to — uploads from a form,
# generated offer letters, KFS and loan packs. Production uses S3, so nothing here is a build input
# or a deployment artefact: each file only means anything beside its row in whichever database wrote
# it, which makes a developer's test uploads pure noise in `git status`.
#
# Files already committed under storage/ stay tracked — this rule only stops NEW ones appearing.
# Untracking the existing ones is deliberately left alone: if any environment serves documents from
# local disk rather than S3, removing them from the repo would 404 real records on the next deploy.
/src/CRMS.Web.Intranet/storage/
